# {{ theme.name }} Ghostty Theme

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This repository is a read-only mirror.
> Issues, pull requests, and stars should go to [{{ slug }}]({{ theme.repository }}).

Ghostty terminal emulator themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

Clone the repository and symlink or copy the theme files:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-ghostty.git
cp {% for v in variants %}{{ theme.id }}-ghostty/{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }} {% endfor %}~/.config/ghostty/themes/
```

Then add to your Ghostty config:

```
theme = {{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}
```
{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}
Or for {{ v.variant.id }}:

```
theme = {{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}
```
{% endfor %}
